    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-172b1d7c-248f-4493-99a7-6168f19dad9f",
      "chapter_id": "ch-0f750de5-669c-45b3-babd-502cb62f6bf3",
      "chapter_number": 8,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚把北堤值守簿交给苏岑，两人约定不再各自隐瞒新线索。",
      "sha256": "356f1372376d61df6ed9af380f9c17ca332b58e5d8e09396df79e419eb5fd18a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-b4a1b231-97f6-4764-93de-c6d85256f568",
      "chapter_id": "ch-0762b811-a35b-4016-94bf-f3905e8f88a5",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "sha256": "2d354cc208c312f81f0d4d72c682603571b1edd1bfaf6bcf3561e4e04a22dc6a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-27f8b197-e34a-40c5-821d-3813408bcf63",
      "chapter_id": "ch-36200426-998f-4116-8cf0-15865bfc4a94",
      "chapter_number": 4,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚看得懂潮表上的坐标，却还不知道‘廊桥钥匙’这个代号指向什么。",
      "sha256": "acdbf3c6f280f8ce238bfd95fffc9f29461689cbd936b4002c519c4f303b5657"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-0e1f2cbd-c6fc-4d10-9f6a-ee882f58dfd2",
      "chapter_id": "ch-0f1e5906-974b-4734-b41f-951dd2789be7",
      "chapter_number": 3,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "十九点二十，西航道先退潮，最后一班渡船在十九点四十才离开风栈码头。",
      "sha256": "640927d1eac69fe6ff8247bbfbb362071d6d8421fe6e6ec6901da4a44471ccb6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
